WEBVTT

1
00:00:03,150 --> 00:00:06,240
The little lady is so witty

2
00:00:06,240 --> 00:00:09,500
Oops, I need to get some cash. It’ll be useful on the road.

3
00:00:09,500 --> 00:00:12,500
If there is a power outage, you can't catch shrimps at that time.

4
00:00:12,500 --> 00:00:14,500
Let's look for a bank

5
00:00:14,500 --> 00:00:17,560
Just change it here. There is plenty of change in the wholesale market.

6
00:00:17,560 --> 00:00:19,560
Sister Wang almost forgot if she didn’t remind me

7
00:00:19,560 --> 00:00:23,560
The remaining 10,000 yuan can be converted into cash

8
00:00:23,560 --> 00:00:40,600
Ouch, it’s safe now

9
00:00:40,600 --> 00:00:45,010
I used to think that Xiao Xiao loved to hoard things.

10
00:00:45,010 --> 00:00:47,010
I didn’t expect this habit to really save lives.

11
00:00:47,010 --> 00:00:49,010
Fortunately, I came early

12
00:00:49,010 --> 00:00:54,100
I heard from the bosses that the price of anything later will have to go up.
